Right? Yes, the kitchen has to be nice.

272
00:22:35,125 --> 00:22:36,585
Has everything here been fixed?

273
00:22:36,668 --> 00:22:38,336
-It's so nice.
-Yes.

274
00:22:39,921 --> 00:22:41,631
-You'll remodel it, right?
-Yes.

275
00:22:41,715 --> 00:22:42,549
Who are you?

276
00:22:46,595 --> 00:22:47,429
Who are you?

277
00:22:47,512 --> 00:22:50,474
-What are you doing here?
-What?

278
00:22:50,557 --> 00:22:51,808
You should be out already.

279
00:22:51,892 --> 00:22:55,061
What are you talking about?
You can't just barge into someone's…

280
00:22:55,562 --> 00:22:56,480
How did you get in?

281
00:22:56,563 --> 00:22:58,899
-I got the passcode for the door.
-From who?

282
00:22:58,982 --> 00:23:00,150
The owner.

283
00:23:00,859 --> 00:23:03,987
I'm the owner. What are you talking about?

284
00:23:04,696 --> 00:23:08,992
I'm the realtor for this apartment.
You're not the owner.

285
00:23:09,075 --> 00:23:11,995
I sold this place three years ago.
What are you talking about?

286
00:23:12,496 --> 00:23:15,207
You've met the owner. The accountant.

287
00:23:16,708 --> 00:23:19,377
This couple already bought the place
in a quick sale.

288
00:23:19,461 --> 00:23:23,757
He said the tenant didn't want visitors,
so I had to show them another place.

289
00:23:27,302 --> 00:23:28,970
Who are you, by the way?

290
00:23:29,554 --> 00:23:31,264
Wait, hold on. I'm his friend.

291
00:23:31,348 --> 00:23:33,433
-Are you the tenant?
-No, I'm the owner.

292
00:23:33,517 --> 00:23:34,976
I don't know what you're saying.

293
00:23:35,060 --> 00:23:37,938
This place is under his name,
but I'm the real owner.

294
00:23:38,021 --> 00:23:40,815
This couple bought the place.
They signed with the owner.

295
00:23:40,899 --> 00:23:44,611
You have to move out today
so they can remodel the place.

296
00:23:44,694 --> 00:23:45,737
Wait.

297
00:23:45,820 --> 00:23:47,113
Sir, what's this?

298
