Please check and try again.

302
00:23:56,331 --> 00:23:58,625
-Honey, I told you to check properly.
-What? Damn it.

303
00:23:58,708 --> 00:24:00,835
You're occupying the place illegally.

304
00:24:01,419 --> 00:24:03,421
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

305
00:24:03,505 --> 00:24:06,091
I told you to just wait!

306
00:24:06,174 --> 00:24:08,176
I'm so sorry. Please wait a moment.

307
00:24:08,260 --> 00:24:10,804
This crazy bastard. Seriously…

308
00:24:11,263 --> 00:24:12,097
WRONG PATTERN

309
00:24:12,180 --> 00:24:13,306
Huh?

310
00:24:16,476 --> 00:24:18,311
Why's this… Damn it.

311
00:24:19,271 --> 00:24:20,730
I CAN'T REGISTER MY FINGERPRINT

312
00:24:20,814 --> 00:24:22,023
Just wait.

313
00:24:22,691 --> 00:24:24,150
I'll get you out of here soon.

314
00:24:25,151 --> 00:24:26,486
Hey!

315
00:24:28,280 --> 00:24:30,949
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

316
00:24:31,032 --> 00:24:33,535
Please check and try again.

317
00:24:43,378 --> 00:24:44,212
Who knows?

318
00:24:44,296 --> 00:24:46,798
Maybe the phone and the glass
were all part of the plan.

319
00:24:50,385 --> 00:24:52,012
Son Soo-hyun, you bastard.

320
00:24:52,095 --> 00:24:54,681
Huh? Where are you going?

321
00:26:30,318 --> 00:26:31,569
Why are you here?

322
00:26:31,653 --> 00:26:35,240
I'm his friend. I know he works here.
Where is he right now?

323
00:26:35,740 --> 00:26:37,784
Soo-hyun quit.

324
00:26:40,328 --> 00:26:41,371
What do you mean?

325
00:26:41,454 --> 00:26:43,206
He quit out of nowhere.

326
00:26:43,289 --> 00:26:45,750
I think he said he was going abroad
for a few years.

327
00:26:45,834 --> 00:26:46,960
He seemed pretty rushed.

328
00:26:47,585 --> 00:26:49,462
He didn't even finish the handover.

329
00:26:57,971 --> 00:27:00,181
Accountants don't just sit around all day.

330
00:27:00,265 --> 00:27:02,183
There's our school reunion today too.

331
00:27:02,267 --> 00:27:03,893
I'm busy as hell.

332
00:27:05,437 --> 00:27:09,899
They meet like every quarter.
They're just meeting up to network.

333
00:27:10,525 --> 00:27:12,402
You were such a loser back in the day.

334
00:27:12,485 --> 00:27:15,405
It's not like you were smart or popular.

335
00:27:15,488 --> 00:27:16,364
Oh man.

336
00:27:16,448 --> 00:27:19,075
Now I'm basically wiping your ass.

337
00:27:19,159 --> 00:27:21,745
None of the guys even remember you.

338
00:27:21,828 --> 00:27:23,496
All they remember is your name.

339
00:27:23,580 --> 00:27:25,373
I mean, your name is pretty unique.

340
00:27:25,457 --> 00:27:27,959
Je Moon-jae.

341
00:27:28,042 --> 00:27:29,419
Oh, remember that place?

342
00:27:30,837 --> 00:27:32,922
You know, that place.

343
00:27:34,549 --> 00:27:37,135
We said we'd go there for drinks
after graduation.

344
00:27:37,218 --> 00:27:38,678
Yeah, that's the place.

345
00:27:39,304 --> 00:27:40,889
We always meet up there.

346
00:27:42,056 --> 00:27:45,477
That place by the Hangang River.
We said the view would be nice there.

347
00:27:46,394 --> 00:27:48,772
The one we said would have a nice view.

348
00:27:53,401 --> 00:27:54,819
THE HANGANG RIVER VIEW

349
00:27:55,945 --> 00:27:57,489
Where is it?

350
00:27:58,072 --> 00:27:59,574
Where the hell is it?!

351
00:28:03,620 --> 00:28:04,829
Q2 SOONGNAM HIGH REUNION

352
00:28:45,995 --> 00:28:47,330
SON SOO-HYUN

353
00:28:48,331 --> 00:28:51,042
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

354
00:28:51,125 --> 00:28:52,585
Please check and…

355
00:28:57,799 --> 00:28:59,551
DRUNK ON THE HANGANG RIVER VIEW

356
